    description: Some("A fixed shooter defending a city. Your ship slides left and right along the top of the screen above two buildings, and you fire upward at a wave of UFOs that are dropping bombs on the skyline; let the buildings take enough hits and the game is over. The draw is scale and speed rather than variety — one relentless screen to survive."),
